Package: tapir
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, podman (>= 4.4), curl, iproute2
Recommends: postgresql, nginx
Description: Member and subscription management for solidarity farms (WirGarten)
 Tapir manages members, subscriptions, coop shares, deliveries and payments.
 .
 This package installs the tools to run Tapir instances - one per solidarity
 farm - as podman containers under systemd: tapir-instance (create, upgrade,
 remove), tapir-kcadm (Keycloak administration on the command line)
 and tapir-manage. Every instance gets its own containers, PostgreSQL
 database, realm in a shared Keycloak and nginx site.
